  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.90\n\nReleased on 2026-09-29.\n\nUndo and redo in Studio update the preview in place instead of reloading it. Clicking an element in the preview selects it faster, without restyling the whole film.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio:** Undo and redo update the preview in place instead of reloading it ([9e1dbca7a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/9e1dbca7a2c2ea7486852efe737b606f86dd4e32), [#4718](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4718)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Studio:** Clicking an element in the preview selects it without restyling the whole film ([1bede4742](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1bede4742a502cf8f6dfaccfafa3f7ef01f12299), [#4707](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4707)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.89...v0.8.90\n"
